{"song_id": 2289056, "title": "Poo-Putt Platter", "language": "en", "lyricists": "[70]", "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "skit", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "I tripped a lot out here in the woods lately, ugh!"}, {"n": "1", "text": "This is a platter of... this makes an, an exceptionally good late night's snack and also a dandy fly swatter"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Ah, my eyes are going, I can't hit it"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Nothing comes between me and my masters"}, {"n": "4", "text": "(What is it father?)"}, {"n": "5", "text": "These footprints were by th\u2014 flying monkey men"}, {"n": "6", "text": "(But they've never strayed from the Valley since we made the pig feet)"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Yes, that is what disturbs me"}, {"n": "8", "text": "He'd probably get indigestion"}, {"n": "9", "text": "You will go"}, {"n": "10", "text": "(I don't think so"}, {"n": "11", "text": "Take them)"}, {"n": "12", "text": "This jungle is dangerous \u2014rapper"}, {"n": "13", "text": "You will need assistance"}, {"n": "14", "text": "(I know what I'm doing)"}, {"n": "15", "text": "You risked your life for us, thanks"}, {"n": "16", "text": "I lost an arm"}, {"n": "17", "text": "(Good)"}, {"n": "18", "text": "Stop it, father!"}, {"n": "19", "text": "(Stand back!"}, {"n": "20", "text": "Return to the house)"}, {"n": "21", "text": "No"}, {"n": "22", "text": "What the?"}, {"n": "23", "text": "Now \u2014rapper, perhaps you will listen"}]}]}